---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '@/components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '@/components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About The Sleep Math — Science-Based Sleep Tools"
  description="The Sleep Math builds free calculators from peer-reviewed sleep research. No wellness fluff — 26 tools designed to help you sleep better."
  canonical="https://thesleepmath.com/about"
>
  <Nav />

  <!-- ===== Hero ===== -->
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="about-container">
      <div class="about-pill">
        <span class="about-pill-dot"></span>
        The anti-wellness-blog
      </div>
      <h1>About <span class="pop">The Sleep Math</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">
        Sleep advice on the internet is mostly garbage. We built something different.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== The Problem ===== -->
  <section class="section section-tint">
    <div class="about-container prose">
      <div class="section-label">The problem</div>
      <h2>The same 12 tips, recycled forever</h2>
      <p>
        "Keep your room cool." "Avoid screens before bed." "Try a warm bath." You've read this
        list. You've read it on WebMD, on sleep brand blogs, on influencer Instagram carousels.
        It's the same advice, reshuffled, copy-pasted since the early 2000s.
      </p>
      <p>
        Here's what that advice doesn't tell you: <em>when</em> is the last safe coffee? Not
        "afternoon" — the actual hour, adjusted for your half-life and bedtime. <em>How much</em>
        melatonin should a 35-year-old actually take? Not "start low" — the dose from the
        study. What is the specific light exposure threshold that suppresses melatonin? The lux
        number exists. It's in a published paper. Nobody's putting it in a calculator.
      </p>
      <p>
        The research is real. It's just buried in PDFs on PubMed that no wellness blogger is
        reading — because the monetizable move is mattress affiliate links, not literature reviews.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== The Approach ===== -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="about-container prose">
      <div class="section-label">The approach</div>
      <h2>Paper first. Calculator second.</h2>
      <p>
        Every tool on this site starts with a specific piece of research. Not a general topic —
        a specific paper, with a specific formula or finding. We read the methods section. We
        extract the model. We build the calculator around it.
      </p>
      <p>
        You enter your inputs — bedtime, wake time, caffeine intake, age, whatever the study
        needs — and you get a personalized result derived from that paper's actual methodology.
        Not a generic range. Not a suggestion. A number that means something.
      </p>
      <div class="approach-cards">
        <div class="approach-card">
          <div class="approach-icon" style="background: var(--primary-soft); color: var(--primary);">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
              <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Start with the paper</h3>
          <p>Find the published study. Read the actual methods. Extract the formula the authors used.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="approach-card">
          <div class="approach-icon" style="background: var(--coral-bg); color: var(--coral);">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Build the calculator</h3>
          <p>Translate the methodology into inputs a real person can fill in. Test it against the paper's examples.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="approach-card">
          <div class="approach-icon" style="background: var(--mint-bg); color: var(--mint);">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Cite the source</h3>
          <p>Link directly to the study. Every result page shows which paper it's from. Check our work.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="small-note">
        No accounts required. No data harvested. No paywalls.
        The tools work in your browser; nothing is stored.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Stats Grid ===== -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="about-container">
      <div class="section-label centered">By the numbers</div>
      <h2 class="centered">What's here right now</h2>
      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-num" style="color: var(--primary);">24</div>
          <div class="stat-label">free calculators</div>
          <div class="stat-sub">covering caffeine, chronotype, sleep debt, nap timing, and more</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-num" style="color: var(--coral);">6+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">peer-reviewed papers cited</div>
          <div class="stat-sub">each one linked directly from the tool that uses it</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-num" style="color: var(--mint);">100%</div>
          <div class="stat-label">free to use</div>
          <div class="stat-sub">no account, no paywall, no email required — ever</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Contact ===== -->
  <section class="section section-tint">
    <div class="about-container">
      <div class="contact-card">
        <div class="contact-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/>
            <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2>Get in touch</h2>
        <p>
          Found a bug? Spotted a study we should turn into a calculator? Want to argue about sleep
          science? We're genuinely interested in all of it.
        </p>
        <a href="mailto:hello@thesleepmath.com" class="contact-link">
          hello@thesleepmath.com
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <p class="contact-note">
          We read everything. Response time varies, but we do respond.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* ===== Layout ===== */
  .about-container {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }

  .section {
    padding: 5rem 0;
  }

  .section-tint {
    background: var(--bg-tint);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  /* ===== Hero ===== */
  .about-hero {
    padding: 5.5rem 0 3.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.85rem 0.3rem 0.45rem;
    background: var(--primary-soft);
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-pill-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    background: var(--primary);
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5.5vw, 3.4rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
  }

  h1 .pop {
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .hero-lead {
    font-size: 1.18rem;
    color: var(--text-mid);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ===== Section labels ===== */
  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .section-label.centered {
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* ===== Prose sections ===== */
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .prose p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-mid);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 1.15rem;
  }

  .prose p em {
    color: var(--text);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .prose p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* ===== Approach Cards ===== */
  .approach-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .approach-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.35rem;
  }

  .approach-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .approach-card h3 {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .approach-card p {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin-bottom: 0 !important;
  }

  .small-note {
    font-size: 0.86rem !important;
    color: var(--text-soft) !important;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--border);
    padding-left: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem !important;
  }

  /* ===== Stats grid ===== */
  h2.centered {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }

  .stats-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .stat-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    transition: border-color 0.15s;
  }

  .stat-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-hover);
  }

  .stat-num {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .stat-sub {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  /* ===== Contact ===== */
  .contact-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 3rem 2.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .contact-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--primary-soft);
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .contact-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .contact-card > p {
    font-size: 0.97rem;
    color: var(--text-mid);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 460px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.75rem;
  }

  .contact-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary-soft);
    padding-bottom: 0.1rem;
    transition: border-color 0.15s, color 0.15s;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .contact-link:hover {
    color: var(--primary-hover);
    border-color: var(--primary);
  }

  .contact-note {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ===== Responsive ===== */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-container {
      padding: 0 1.25rem;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 3.5rem 0;
    }

    .about-hero {
      padding: 3.5rem 0 2.5rem;
    }

    .approach-cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .stats-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .contact-card {
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
